OL,3,GNEWSAChief coroner calls for inquiry
OL,4,Ainto Manchester synagogue attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief coroner overseeing inquests
OL,7,Finto the deaths of two men killed in
OL,8,Fthe attack on a Manchester synagogue is
OL,9,Fto ask the government to hold a public
OL,10,Finquiry instead.
OL,12,FJudge Alexia Durran, chief coroner of
OL,13,FEngland and Wales, said she would write
OL,14,Fto Home Secretary Shabana Mahmood to
OL,15,Frecommend the inquests be converted
OL,16,Finto a public inquiry after being told
OL,17,Fsome MI5 material could not be heard in
OL,18,Fopen court because of national security
OL,19,Fconcerns.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
