OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAChief coroner calls for inquiry
OL,4,Ainto Manchester synagogue attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FInquests were planned into the deaths
OL,7,Fof Adrian Daulby, 53, and Melvin
OL,8,FCravitz, 66, following the attack by
OL,9,FJihad Al-Shamie, 35, a Syrian-born
OL,10,FBritish citizen, on Heaton Park Hebrew
OL,11,FCongregation synagogue in Manchester
OL,12,Flast October.
OL,14,FInquests have no mechanism to hold
OL,15,Fsecret or private hearings, excluding
OL,16,Fpress and public.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
